#
# File:         sdkconfig.defaults.fncam
# Module:       Build / ESP-IDF defaults, Freenove ESP32-WROVER CAM layer
#
# Purpose:      What the Freenove ESP32-WROVER CAM build changes from
#               sdkconfig.defaults. Not an sdkconfig.defaults.esp32: that
#               name would apply to every ESP32 build, the WROOM's included.
#               platformio.ini names this file for the board's environments
#               through SDKCONFIG_DEFAULTS (board_build.cmake_extra_args),
#               which IDF 5.3.1's project.cmake takes in place of the
#               default list, so sdkconfig.defaults is named first there.
#
#               PlatformIO only watches sdkconfig.defaults for changes:
#               delete sdkconfig.freenove_wrover_cam* after editing here, and
#               check the generated file. A value outside its Kconfig range
#               is discarded, not clamped.
#
#               Every value is measured or sourced in
#               internal/PLAN-freenove-cam.md, section 3.
#
# Targets:      ESP32-WROVER-E (ESP-IDF 5.3.1)
# See also:     sdkconfig.defaults, platformio.ini, src/board.h
#
